    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651580/extras/21787cd1bff6de5a567ca01a2b5a1d2c.avif?t=1626765416\" /></div><br>- Play 21 games through the 2020-2021 BeerLeague Season.<br><br>- Customize your Appearance, Jersey, and Shoes with over 40+ Items.<br><br>- Go Head-2-Head against 9 Unique Teams from the BeerLeague Universe.<br><br>- Choose from 14 moves to learn and perfect.<br><br>- Use your moves to earn Points, Rebounds, Assists, Steals, and Blocks Statistics.<br><br>- Become an All-Star, Win the BeerLeague Championship, and prove you are a Superstar!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651580/extras/21787cd1bff6de5a567ca01a2b5a1d2c.avif?t=1626765416\" /></div><br>- Play 21 games through the 2020-2021 BeerLeague Season.<br><br>- Customize your Appearance, Jersey, and Shoes with over 40+ Items.<br><br>- Go Head-2-Head against 9 Unique Teams from the BeerLeague Universe.<br><br>- Choose from 14 moves to learn and perfect.<br><br>- Use your moves to earn Points, Rebounds, Assists, Steals, and Blocks Statistics.<br><br>- Become an All-Star, Win the BeerLeague Championship, and prove you are a Superstar!",
